            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Nnipa bebree bɛfa akwammɔne so na ɛsiane deɛ wɔyɛ no enti, nnipa bɛkasa atia nokorɛ ɛkwan no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53c3c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Saa atorɔ adiyifoɔ yi nam wɔn sikanibereɛ so bɛto anansesɛm akyerɛ mo de apɛ mo ho mfasoɔ. Wɔn ɔtemmufoɔ siesiee ne ho akyɛre, na saa ara nso na wɔn ɔsɛefoɔ no nso asɔre agyina.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53ca5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn amfa abɔfoɔ a wɔyɛɛ bɔne no ho ankyɛre wɔn. Ɔtoo wɔn guu asaman sum mu baabi guu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn, na ɛhɔ na wɔretwɛn Atemmuo da no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53ce5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn amma tete ewiase no amfa ne ho anni. Ɔmaa nsuyire baa wɔn a wɔannye asɛm no anni no so. Wɔn a ɔgyee wɔn nkwa no ne Noa a ɔkaa tenenee ho asɛm no ne nnipa baason bi.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53d10",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn buu Sodom ne Gomora fɔ de ogya sɛee wɔn, de bɔɔ wɔn a wɔnnye Onyankopɔn nni no kɔkɔ.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53d54",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Ɔgyee Lot a ɔyɛ ɔteneneeni no firii nnipa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nsam.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53dae",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Na saa ɔteneneeni no te saa nnipa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no mu na afideɛ a na saa nnipa no yɛ no adekyeeɛ ne adesaeɛ no ha no yie.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53dd7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Yei kyerɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn nim ɛkwan a ɔfa so gye nʼakyidifoɔ firi ɔhaw mu, ɛnna ɔnim ɛkwan a ɔfa so kora nnipa nnebɔneyɛfoɔ, twe wɔn aso de twɛn Atemmuo da no,",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53e13",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "ne titire no, wɔn a wɔdi wɔn honam akɔnnɔ akyi na wɔpa Onyankopɔn tumi no.\n    Saa atorɔ akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ yi wɔ akokoɔduru na wɔmmu animuonyamfoɔ a wɔwɔ ɔsoro no, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔte wɔn atua.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53e28",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Na abɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ ahoɔden ne tumi sene saa atorɔ akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ yi mpo nka nsɛmmɔne mmu wɔn atɛn wɔ Awurade anim.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53e38",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Nanso, saa nnipa yi yɛ wɔn nneɛma te sɛ mmoa a wonni adwene, wɔwo wɔn sɛ wɔnkye wɔn nku wɔn. Wɔgu nneɛma biara a wɔnte aseɛ no ho fi. Wɔbɛsɛe wɔn sɛ mmoa.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53e87",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Ɔhaw a wɔma ɛbaeɛ no, wɔbɛtua wɔn so ka. Deɛ wɔn ani gye ho ne sɛ wɔbɛyɛ biribiara awia ketee a ɛbɛyɛ ama wɔn honam akɔnnɔ. Sɛ wɔne mo to nsa didi a, ɛgu wɔn anim ase. Ɛfiri sɛ, saa ɛberɛ no na wɔka nnaadaasɛm.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53ecb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Wɔnhwehwɛ hwee sɛ mmaa adwamanfoɔ ɛfiri sɛ, wɔpɛ sɛ daa wɔyɛ bɔne. Wɔdaadaa nnipa a wɔyɛ mmerɛ kɔ bɔne mu. Wɔayɛn wɔn akoma ama anibereɛ. Wɔwɔ Onyankopɔn nnome ase.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fc531092a820c53ee1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Wɔamane afiri ɛkwan tee no so enti wɔayera. Wɔafa ɛkwan a Beor ba Bileam a ne sika a ɔnya de yɛ bɔne no kɔfaa so no so.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c53f30",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Yei maa wɔkaa nʼanim wɔ ne bɔne no ho. Nʼafunumu de onipa nne kasaeɛ de sii odiyifoɔ no abɔdamsɛm no ho ɛkwan.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c53f80",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Saa nnipa yi te sɛ asutire a awe anaasɛ omununkum a mframa bɔ no. Onyankopɔn de wɔn asie esum kabii mu wɔ baabi.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c53fe0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Wɔka ahantansɛm ne nkwaseasɛm na wɔnam wɔn honam akɔnnɔ ho nnaadaa so twetwe wɔn a wɔatwe wɔn ho afiri nnebɔneyɛfoɔ ho.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c54019",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Wɔhyɛ wɔn ahofadie ho bɔ wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔn ankasa wɔyɛ bɔne nkoa ɛfiri sɛ, onipa yɛ akoa ma biribiara a ɛdi no so.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c54065",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Na sɛ onipa sua yɛn Awurade ne yɛn Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo ho asɛm, na ɔnam so dwane firi ewiase yi mu akwammɔne so, na akyire no ɔkɔ bɔne mu bio ma ɔdane bɔne akoa a, ɛnneɛ ɛyɛ hu sene ne kane no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c540cd",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.21",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Sɛ wɔnnim Kristo koraa a, anka ɛyɛ ma wɔn sene sɛ wɔbɛsua ne ho nsɛm na afei wɔbɛdane wɔn akyi akyerɛ mmara Kronkron a wɔde maa wɔn no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:21",
        "verseNumber": "21",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c540fc",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.2.22",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a77",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.2",
        "content": "Deɛ ɛbaa wɔn so no kyerɛ sɛ, saa ɛbɛ yi yɛ nokorɛ. “Ɔkraman sane kɔtafere ne fe ɛnna ɔprako a wɔadware no no nso kɔyantam wɔ atɛkyɛ mu.”",
        "reference": "2 Petro 2:22",
        "verseNumber": "22",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c541b8",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Adɔfonom, yei ne krataa a ɛtɔ so mmienu a matwerɛ abrɛ mo. Metwerɛɛ sɛ mede rebɛkae mo, de akanyane mo adwene.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c54232",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Mepɛ sɛ mokae nsɛm a adiyifoɔ kronkron no kaa mmerɛ bi a atwam no ne mmara a ɛfiri Awurade ne Agyenkwa a wɔde faa mo asomafoɔ so maa mo no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fd531092a820c54270",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, ɛsɛ sɛ mote aseɛ sɛ nna a ɛdi akyire no mu no, nnipa bi bɛba a wɔn ara wɔn honam akɔnnɔ na ɛbɛdi wɔn so. Wɔbɛdi mo ho fɛ",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c542a5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "aka sɛ, “Ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ sɛ ɔbɛba. Wanka? Na ɔwɔ he? Yɛn agyanom awuwu dada, nanso biribiara te sɛ deɛ ɛte firi adebɔ mfitiaseɛ!”",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c542d7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Wɔhyɛ da ma wɔn werɛ firi nokorɛ no sɛ, ɛfiri tete no, Onyankopɔn kasaeɛ na wɔbɔɔ ɔsoro ne asase. Wɔbɔɔ asase firi nsuo mu na wɔde nsuo na ɛyɛeɛ.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c54322",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Akyire no wɔde nsuyire bɛsɛee no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c54353",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Nanso, Onyankopɔn ahyɛ sɛ ɔsoro ne asase ntena hɔ nkɔsi Atemmuo da. Afei wɔbɛsɔ emu ogya na wɔbɛsɛe nnebɔneyɛfoɔ.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c54386",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Nanso, anuanom, mommma mo werɛ mfiri adeɛ baako sɛ Awurade ani so deɛ, nsonsonoeɛ nni da koro ne mfeɛ apem ntam. Ne fam deɛ, ne mmienu nyinaa yɛ pɛ.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c543df",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Awurade ntwentwɛn ne nan ase wɔ ne bɔ a wahyɛ ho sɛdeɛ ebinom dwene no. Mmom, ɔwɔ mo ho boasetɔ ɛfiri sɛ, ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔbɛsɛe obiara, na mmom, ɔpɛ sɛ obiara sakra firi ne bɔne ho.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c5442b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Na Awurade da no bɛba sɛ owifoɔ. Ɛda no, ɔsoro bɛbobom na ayera na ewiem nneɛma bɛhye na asɛe na asase ne so nneɛma nyinaa nso bɛda adi.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c544b6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Sɛ saa ɛkwan yi so na wɔbɛfa asɛe adeɛ nyinaa a, na ɛdeɛn bra na ɛsɛ sɛ wobɔ? Ɛsɛ sɛ mo bra yɛ kronkron na mode mo ho ma Onyankopɔn.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c544df",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Monhwɛ saa da no kwan na monyɛ mo nneɛma pɛpɛɛpɛ; saa da a Onyankopɔn bɛto ɔsoro mu ogya na ewiem nneɛma anane na ayera wɔ ogyaframa mu no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c544fd",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Nanso, yɛtwɛn deɛ Onyankopɔn ahyɛ yɛn ho bɔ no, ɔsoro foforɔ ne asase foforɔ a ɛhɔ na tenenee bɛtena.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c5450f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Enti, anuanom, mogu so retwɛn da no yi, mommɔ mmɔden sɛ mobɛyɛ kronn a mfomsoɔ biara nni mo ho wɔ Onyankopɔn anim na mo ne no atena wɔ asomdwoeɛ mu.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c5451e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Monkae nhunu sɛ Awurade wɔ boasetɔ ɛfiri sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ obiara nya nkwagyeɛ. Ɛno na yɛn nua Paulo nam nyansa a Onyankopɔn de maa no no so twerɛɛ mo no.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c54572",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so na ɔfa twerɛɛ ne nkrataa no na saa nsɛm yi ara so nso na ɔgyina twerɛeɛ. Nsɛm bi a ɛyɛ den wɔ ne nkrataa no mu no, wɔn a wɔnnim na wɔnnyɛ den no ntumi nkyerɛ aseɛ yie. Saa ara na wɔyɛ Atwerɛsɛm a aka no de ɔsɛeɛ ba wɔn so.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c545ad",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Nanso anuanom, mo deɛ monim yei dada. Monwɛn na wɔn a wɔnni mmara so annaadaa mo amfiri beaeɛ pa.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590fe531092a820c545c5",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "2PE.3.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "2PE",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd47999137613db5a99",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "2PE",
            "id": "2PE.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd47999137613db5a10"
        },
        "chapterId": "2PE.3",
        "content": "Monyini wɔ yɛn Awurade ne Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo adom ne nimdeɛ mu.\n    \n    \n    Ɔno na animuonyam nka no seesei ne daa. Amen.",
        "reference": "2 Petro 3:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    }
]